      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I've found a reliable repro for this and recorded a couple videos. Entering a station that tilts and/or gets disabled after the player exits and then begin walking, will frequently cause this. The typical flying vehicle prefab shown in the videos seems ideal for testing.\nPlease feel free to reach out if any assistance is needed for repro.\nhttps://youtu.be/qlv8dIK2iUE\nhttps://youtu.be/ekjTBcpS0OY",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
